name: Couch Photo Chad
author: nat break run
description: >
  Face card + Hanging Chad retriggers Photograph's X2. Red deck, White stake.
  Photo ante 1-3, Chad ante 1-4. Soft should-score for early Uncommon/Rare tags.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - commonJoker: Photograph
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
  - commonJoker: HangingChad
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4]
should:
  - tag: UncommonTag
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 20
  - tag: RareTag
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30

seeds:
  - 6Y6
  - Q
